          "Add the shallot, mushroom, and shredded pork.",
          "Add all the seasonings.",
          "Add the glutinous rice and stir-fry slowly over low heat until well combined, then switch to high heat and keep stir-frying, adding liquid a little at a time. Once the ginger/aromatics are fully cooked through, stir-fry one more time before finishing."
